//// The `jhonstart-link` package — module-tree root.
////
//// Client navigation's RENDER-TIME half (front 27), cut out of the jhonstart
//// core by front 95 (`specs/1.0.10-beta/04-jhonstart/modules.md` § 1): `link`
//// (the anchor, its props and the prefetch decision) and `reconcile` (the
//// layout keys and the remount decision of a client transition). Both are
//// pure. The browser half — `linkMount`, `linkPrefetch`, `linkRouteKind` and
//// the `linkStatus` hook — sits over four DUAL-target cells
//// (`link_runtime.mjs` / `sidecars/jhonstart_link.erl`), so the member keeps
//// the workspace's two targets and every assertion runs on both rows. A
//// consumer writes `import {Link} from "jhonstart-link";` beside
//// `import {div, a} from "jhonstart";`.

pub mod link;
pub mod reconcile;
